<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod (Vertebrate embryonic autopod (Mus musculus distal Hox/Gli3 allelic series & postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph))",
        "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod faithfully reproduces Vertebrate embryonic autopod (Mus musculus distal Hox/Gli3 allelic series & postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Vertebrate embryonic autopod (Mus musculus distal Hox/Gli3 allelic series & postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-hox-turing-polydactyly-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py> ;
    schema:about "Vertebrate embryonic autopod (Mus musculus distal Hox/Gli3 allelic series & postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph)" ;
