<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the exact Sheth et al. (2012) Science Fig. 3 & Suppl. Eqs. (S1)-(S6) dispersion curve Re(sigma(k)) and Hox-modulated critical wavenumber k_c^2(H) = (Dv*fu(H) + Du*gv)/(2*Du*Dv) = (14 - 9*H)^2 (L90-165); numerically integrates the nonlinear cubic-saturated 2-component reaction-diffusion PDE via a DCT-II IMEX solver on both the 1D distal autopod arc (L171-251) and the 2D polar fan-shaped limb bud sector with proximodistal Fgf/Wnt-Hox modulation (L254-345, reproducing 2 proximal zeugopod rays -> 5 WT or 14 triple-null distal digits); and backs all 3 governing laws with machine-checked Lean 4 proofs in `Loop_015_hox_turing_polydactyly.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L554-614) extracts 8 reference-backed quantitative morphometrics covering WT pentadactyl digit count (5.0 vs 5.0 ref), Gli3-/- digit count (7.0 vs 6.8 ref), Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- digit count (9.0 vs 9.2 ref), Hoxa13-/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- triple-null digit count (14.0 vs 13.6 ref), WT-to-triple-null wavelength compression ratio (2.80x vs 2.80x ref), inverse wavelength L/lambda(H) vs PDE digit count correlation (Pearson r = 1.0, p < 1e-16), negative-control amplitude quenching (std_u = 3.6e-5 at Du=Dv and 2.5e-5 at fu=1.5), and segmented hexadactylous radiograph inter-digit spacing CV (0.0580 vs 0.0580 ref)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-allelic-series-inverse-wavelength-l-lambda-h-vs-pde-digit-count-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-equal-diffusion-du-dv-and-sub-turing-fu-1-5-negative-control-amplitude>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-gli3-mutant-autopod-pde-digit-count-n-h-0-78>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-hoxa13-hoxd11-13-gli3-triple-null-pde-digit-count-n-h-0-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-hoxd11-13-gli3-double-mutant-pde-digit-count-n-h-0-56>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-segmented-hexadactylous-autopod-radiograph-digit-ray-count-spacing-cv>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-wt-pentadactyl-autopod-pde-digit-count-n-h-1-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-measurement-wt-to-triple-null-turing-stripe-wavelength-ratio-lambda-wt-lambda-null>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sheth et al. (2012) Science distal Hoxa13/Hoxd11-13 + Gli3 dose modulation of Turing digit wavelength on a fan-shaped embryonic autopod — MorphoEval overall 92.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) post-remediation evaluation of `2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py` (overall weighted score: 92.1 / 100, up +44.1 points from 48.0 / 100 in Pass 1). The remediated script numerically integrates the nonlinear cubic-saturated 2-component Sheth et al. (2012) Turing reaction-diffusion PDE with zero-flux Neumann boundaries on both the 1D distal autopod arc and the 2D curvilinear polar fan-shaped limb bud sector (demonstrating 2 proximal zeugopod elements branching into N(H) distal digit rays across the mesopodium wrist gate); reproduces the complete 6-genotype allelic series (WT 5 digits -> Gli3-/- 7 -> Hoxd11-13+/-;Gli3-/- 8 -> Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 9 -> Hoxa13+/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 11 -> Hoxa13-/-;Hoxd11-13-/-;Gli3-/- 14 thin closely-spaced digits) at constant autopod width L = 2500 um; verifies dual negative controls (equal diffusion Du = Dv = 0.5 and sub-Turing ablation fu = 1.5); segments all 6 digit rays on a SHA-256-locked postaxial hexadactylous autopod radiograph; and backs its core mathematical laws with 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_015_hox_turing_polydactyly.lean`. Overall 92.0/100 (faithfulness 91.6, reproducibility 92.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 94, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/hox_turing_polydactyly_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly.py at 8871db0, image/png, 725726 B, 2193×1323 px, artifact_sha256 dfa8cd3145a6bc603c86306ef4b4b1364dde5e2f875ee9290209fe26a6e6511f (sha256 dfa8cd3145a6bc603c86306ef4b4b1364dde5e2f875ee9290209fe26a6e6511f), spec_fingerprint 4ba645a060b448f2c2c1acc18c47a660ef9f21e12216d12473ce8eae3ddb3de8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 4ba645a060b448f2c2c1acc18c47a660ef9f21e12216d12473ce8eae3ddb3de8; artifact_sha256: dfa8cd3145a6bc603c86306ef4b4b1364dde5e2f875ee9290209fe26a6e6511f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/hox_turing_polydactyly_reference.json=06c60968ccdce3a7..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/scout_manifest.json=c0608869f6d213a4..., datasets/hox_turing_polydactyly/vertebrate_autopod_digits_specimen.jpg=995e43a2a0cf7815...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-hox-turing-polydactyly-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D polar fan-shaped limb bud Turing solver to a deforming tissue-mechanics mesh driven by localized AER-FGF8 mitogenic outgrowth." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sheth-hox-turing-polydactyly-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
